@startuml XhRec 自动录制引擎核心时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFDF9
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  BorderColor #2E6DA4
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #444444
}

actor "用户/扩展" as User
participant "HttpServer\n/ WebUI" as HTTP
participant "Scheduler" as Sched
participant "Session" as Session
participant "ApiClient\n/ Platform API" as API
participant "M3u8Parser\n/ Decrypter" as M3U8
participant "Downloader" as DL
participant "CdnSelector" as Sel
participant "CDN / HLS" as CDN
participant "DataChannel" as DC
participant "Writer" as Writer
participant "PostProcessor" as PP
participant "ffmpeg/shell" as Tool

User -> HTTP : 激活房间 / 添加房间
HTTP -> Sched : ActivateRecordingCmd / AddRoom
Sched -> Session : DoStart(roomId, quality, pkey)

activate Session
Session -> API : roomFetchBroadcastInfo / master playlist
API --> Session : 房间信息 / 流地址

Session -> M3U8 : 解析 master/media playlist
M3U8 --> Session : 清晰度变体 / 分片 URL / PSCH key

Session -> Session : 选画质、resolveVariantUrl、设置 token/pkey

Session -> DL : DoDownload(segments)
activate DL
DL -> Sel : select() / resolve(url)
Sel --> DL : 最快 CDN 地址
DL -> CDN : GET HLS segment(s)
CDN --> DL : 分片数据 / 失败
DL -> DL : 直连/代理竞争 + 限流
DL -> DC : StreamStart / StreamData / StreamEnd (经 OrderedEmitter)
deactivate DL

DC -> Writer : 流数据
activate Writer
Writer -> Writer : 写临时 MP4 / .event 文件
Writer --> DC : 继续接收下一分片
DC --> Writer : StreamEnd / CutPoint
Writer -> Writer : 关闭、重命名、发布 FileReady
Writer -> PP : FileReady
deactivate Writer

activate PP
PP -> Tool : fix_stamp / move / slice / shell
Tool --> PP : 处理完成
PP -> PP : 发布 FileProcessed
deactivate PP

Session --> Session : 轮询下一批分片/检查限时限大小
Session -> DL : DoCutPoint(TimeLimit/SizeLimit/StreamEnd)

@enduml
